    "show_share": true,
    "description": "As Primary Health Care is a major component of undergraduate medical education at The Aga Khan University (AKU), Dr Parvez Nayani, Senior Instructor, Department of Community Health Sciences, was invited to present the AKU experience at a recent conference in Beirut, organized by the World Health Organization (WHO) and the American University of Beirut.",
